+            srcset="/media/archives/images/medium/heic0211i.jpg 320w, https://cdn.esahubble.org/archives/images/news/heic0211i.jpg 180w, /media/archives/images/newsmini/heic0211i.jpg 60w, https://cdn.esahubble.org/archives/images/screen/heic0211i.jpg 1280w, https://cdn.esahubble.org/archives/images/thumb700x/heic0211i.jpg 700w, /media/archives/images/thumbs/heic0211i.jpg 122w"
